### Get all users
GET http://localhost:7075/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete user (ADMIN)
DELETE http://localhost:7075/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add role
POST http://localhost:7075/api/users/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Add child
POST http://localhost:7075/api/users/1/children
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Emma",
  "age": 5
}